title: "LeakageSafe-ClinicalML"

abstract: >-
  Reproducible research software for leakage-safe structured clinical
  machine learning, including repeated-holdout evaluation, training-strategy
  comparison, statistical analysis, subgroup fairness assessment, and
  traceable experimental results.

